193
00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.130
Yes.

194
00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.390
Primo shot.

195
00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:22.870
It's right behind Phyllis.

196
00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:28.030
And I just looked at it and I started cracking up because I feel like those red vines would

197
00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:31.950
survive, you know, Armageddon because they were so shellacked and gross.

198
00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:33.250
Oh, my gosh.

199
00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.330
You couldn't eat them.

200
00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.790
They were like sticks.

201
00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:37.410
Yeah.

202
00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.190
