00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.550
I have to tell you when I go to the movies.

210
00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:54.450
Me too.

211
00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:56.410
Red vines or junior mints?

212
00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:58.530
Aw, that's so cute.

213
00:09:58.730 --> 00:09:58.950
Yeah.

214
00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:03.590
So Toby is chatting with Pam, Oscar, Phyllis, and Meredith.

215
00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:09.890
All about this wilderness retreat that he went on with Ryan and some of the other branch

216
00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:10.430
