Three talking heads where the people say the same thing.

222
00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.950
Phyllis, Toby, you.

223
00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.110
Michael wasn't invited.

224
00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.450
He wasn't invited.

225
00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:31.330
Toby was.

226
00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.070
Michael wasn't.

227
00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:36.490
