239
00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.610
If someone tells you they have a green initiative, it's a scam.

240
00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.850
Oh, my gosh.

241
00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:20.610
And then he's saying that now that he's like the green wonder kid, you know, the green

242
