environmentalist, that it's going to impress the ladies of the office.

243
00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.130
And he purposefully like puts a plastic water bottle in the recycle bin by a group of women

244
00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.630
and they don't even acknowledge him.

245
00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.210
It's hilarious.

246
00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:35.810
Well, we had a fan question about this scene from Stephanie Pollan, Catherine Loza, Zach

